# DoorHub ERP V2 Requirements

## Order Creation

- Auto-generated order number.
- Customer search dropdown.
- Create Customer from order screen.
- Product search dropdown.
- Create Product from order screen.
- Multiple products per order.
- Notes field.
- Attachments upload.
- Advance payment field (optional).
- No vendor assignment during order creation.
- No measurements during order creation.
- No status selection during order creation.

## Payments

- Payments are order-level only.
- No product-level payments.
- Advance payment creates first payment entry.
- Payment status auto-calculated.

Rules:

Pending = Paid Amount = 0

Partial = Paid Amount > 0 and < Total

Paid = Paid Amount >= Total

- Payment history editable.
- Payment history deletable.

## Vendor Assignment

- Vendor assignment after order creation.
- Admin only.
- Vendor can be changed anytime.
- Vendor can be removed anytime.
- Assigning vendor automatically changes status to Vendor Assigned.

## Orders

- Default Orders page uses Kanban view.

Columns:

- New
- Vendor Assigned
- Under Production
- Ready
- Installed
- Payment Pending
- Completed

- Clicking card opens order details.

## Dashboard

Quick Action Cards:

- New Order
- Add Product
- Receive Payment

Payment Summary card clickable.

## Search

Global search across:

- Orders
- Customers
- Products
- Vendors

## Notes

- Notes field on orders.
- Editable later.

## Attachments

- Upload photos.
- Upload PDFs.
- Upload documents.
- Upload additional files later.

## Roles

Sales:
- Customers
- Orders
- Products in Orders
- Status Updates

Admin:
- Vendor Assignment
- Payments
- Products
- Settings
- Users